# AI agent skills — vendored via skills.sh + curated
# .agents/ is the skills.sh ecosystem folder:
# - .agents/skills/ — vendored skills (committed for reproducibility)
# - .agents/skills.index.json — generated index (committed)
# Other .agents/* (e.g. Claude, Cursor) may be local and are ignored
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/
!.agents/skills/**
!.agents/skills.index.json
!.agents/README.md

